; ── Nelly · Bottle Fairy ───────────────────────────────────────
; Battle focus: Rune skill  ＋  Magic Surge (energy x2)  ＋  Four-color combo

@stopBgm
@bgm happy
@back bg01 time:0.3
@char 涅莉 pos:50 time:0

涅莉.yummy: Oh oh~ Someone came to play with me! I haven't used my fairy rune in ages — perfect timing!

@choice "Bring it on!" goto:.battle_intro
@stop

# battle_intro
涅莉.exc: Fairy power is nothing like witch magic — this is energy stored for hundreds of years!
涅莉.happy: Ready? I'm going to release all of my rune power —

@sfx bling loop:false
涅莉: Now witness what a true combo move really looks like!

@hide 涅莉
@set RuneActive=true
@battle background:bg01 target:monster01 scriptName:demo_nelly label:afterbattle
@stop


; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# afterbattle
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

@stopBgm
@bgm happy
@back bg01 time:0.3
@char 涅莉 pos:50 time:0

涅莉.happy: How was it? Could you feel the power of the fairy rune?
涅莉.yummy: Good effort! Now go swap for a new rune and get even stronger!

@hide 涅莉
@GotoChangeRune scriptName:demo label:aftermap
@stop
